## Deliverables

| # | Product | Path | Done when |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | Topic notes, the source of truth | `notes/NN-<slug>.md` | `linkcheck.py` clean (plain-text notes: references checked by hand), reviews applied |
| 2 | Notes page | `_build/notes.html`, a private artifact | `verify_page.mjs` passes, URL in STATUS |
